window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>From <i>New York Times</i> and <i>USA TODAY</i> best-selling author Kym Grosso, comes <i>Solstice Burn</i>, a Club Altura romance novella.... </p> <p>Temptations flare in the hedonistic tropics when wealthy philanthropist and professional deep sea diver, Chase Abbott, rescues a beautiful woman at sea. Penny Travis, a big city lawyer, may have been looking for relaxation at the exclusive adults' resort, but she soon embraces adventure, submitting to secret fantasies within the arms of her charismatic hero. </p> <p><b>Warning: This book contains several erotic love scenes and is intended for adult listeners only. </b> </p>"; 
